{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobble Wars: Physics-Based Chaos. Competitive Mayhem.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bounce, dash, and smash your way to victory in <strong>Wobble Wars</strong>, a free-to-play, fast-paced physics-based multiplayer arena game where every hit, bump, and fall is pure mayhem. Play solo, online, or with friends \u2014 and prove who\u2019s the ultimate wobble champion!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Combat</strong> \u2014 Harness momentum, power-ups, ricochets, and dashes to send opponents flying off the competition or straight into traps. Every hit feels dynamic thanks to fully simulated physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Movement</strong> \u2014 Master precision rolling, spin boosts, bounce timing, and wall ricochets to outplay your rivals. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> \u2014 Jump into matches with up to 8 players online or go local with split-screen multiplayer. Laugh, rage, and roll together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes Galore</strong> \u2014 Compete in Capture the Flag, One Flag, Races, Football, King of the Hill, and more. Expect rotating events and seasonal chaos to keep gameplay fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization &amp; Progression</strong> \u2014 Unlock hundreds of skins, trails, flags, emotes, and taunts to personalize your wobble and show off your unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constantly Evolving</strong> \u2014 Enjoy new maps, updates, and limited-time events with every season. The chaos never stops!</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobble Wars</strong> combines the chaotic fun of party games with the depth of competitive multiplayer, delivering an experience that\u2019s equally fun for casual players and hardcore competitors. Whether you\u2019re rolling with friends or facing global players in ranked arenas \u2014 it\u2019s pure, physics-driven fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682170?t=1765478259","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682170?t=1765478259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/251a48fb9712205634093fa1d8a0d58797fd4488/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765478259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/251a48fb9712205634093fa1d8a0d58797fd4488/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765478259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobble Wars: Physics-Based Chaos. Competitive Mayhem.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bounce, dash, and smash your way to victory in <strong>Wobble Wars</strong>, a free-to-play, fast-paced physics-based multiplayer arena game where every hit, bump, and fall is pure mayhem. Play solo, online, or with friends \u2014 and prove who\u2019s the ultimate wobble champion!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Combat</strong> \u2014 Harness momentum, power-ups, ricochets, and dashes to send opponents flying off the competition or straight into traps. Every hit feels dynamic thanks to fully simulated physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Movement</strong> \u2014 Master precision rolling, spin boosts, bounce timing, and wall ricochets to outplay your rivals. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> \u2014 Jump into matches with up to 8 players online or go local with split-screen multiplayer. Laugh, rage, and roll together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes Galore</strong> \u2014 Compete in Capture the Flag, One Flag, Races, Football, King of the Hill, and more. Expect rotating events and seasonal chaos to keep gameplay fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization &amp; Progression</strong> \u2014 Unlock hundreds of skins, trails, flags, emotes, and taunts to personalize your wobble and show off your unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constantly Evolving</strong> \u2014 Enjoy new maps, updates, and limited-time events with every season. The chaos never stops!</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobble Wars</strong> combines the chaotic fun of party games with the depth of competitive multiplayer, delivering an experience that\u2019s equally fun for casual players and hardcore competitors. Whether you\u2019re rolling with friends or facing global players in ranked arenas \u2014 it\u2019s pure, physics-driven fun.</p>","developers":["Hito Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/af7a1168baa54a567a1d1ce466479a579931a435/header.jpg?t=1765478259","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong