am/apps/3682170/924fe81e4b14a9e33d3682f310c8e4a8e05ecb0b/ss_924fe81e4b14a9e33d3682f310c8e4a8e05ecb0b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765478259","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/924fe81e4b14a9e33d3682f310c8e4a8e05ecb0b/ss_924fe81e4b14a9e33d3682f310c8e4a8e05ecb0b.600x338.jpg?t=1765478259"}],"short_description":"Wobble Wars is a fast-paced, physics-based multiplayer (Non Shooter) Capture the Flag, where rolling, bouncing, and bashing are the keys to victory. Compete in hilarious arenas, master momentum-based movement, and customize your wobble warrior in the ultimate spherical showdown!","steam_appid":3682170,"support_info":{"email":"wobblewars@gmail.com","url":"https://playwobblewars.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://playwobblewars.com/"}